Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}南北绿豆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}有肉，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}怎么不卖？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}肉在井里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}掌柜说了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:23.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}谁搬得开，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}就让谁取。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}按你掌柜的话办。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}掌柜，就是他。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}你卖的是豆，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.87,0:00:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}还是粉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}你捏碎我的豆，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}还问我？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}你分了我的肉，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}又怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}磨盘是我搬的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}你自己定的规矩，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}认不认？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}先让我看看，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}你有多大本事！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}没必要用枪，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}也照样分个高下！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}二位壮咪，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,650)}住爪。
